// Outside any type body `Self` names nothing, so it stays an unknown type. The rule is stated once:
// what the checker resolves and what it validates read the same binding, so there is no position
// where `Self` checks clean and then resolves to nothing.
// expect: error E0013 at 7:12
// expect: error E0007 at 8:12
// expect: exit 1
fn free(): Self {
    return 1;
}

echo free();
